      </section>
      <h3 id="node-configuration-crs_telco-core" class="group scroll-mt-20">Node configuration reference CRs<a href="#node-configuration-crs_telco-core" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">Use the following custom resources (CRs) to configure node settings for the telco core profile.</p>
