      <h3 id="networking-crs_telco-core" class="group scroll-mt-20">Networking reference CRs<a href="#networking-crs_telco-core" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
      <p class="_abstract">Use the following custom resources (CRs) to configure networking components for the telco core profile.</p>
      <p><strong>Networking CRs</strong></p>
      <Table class="my-4">
      <TableHeader>
      <TableRow>
