      <TableRow>
      <TableCell>Baseline</TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>Network.yaml</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Configures the default cluster network, specifying OVN Kubernetes settings like routing via the host. It also allows the definition of additional networks, including custom CNI configurations, and enables the use of MultiNetworkPolicy CRs for network policies across multiple networks.</TableCell>
      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
