      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell>Load Balancer</TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>bgp-peer.yaml</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Defines a BGP peer in MetalLB, representing a BGP neighbor for dynamic routing.</TableCell>
      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell>Load Balancer</TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>community.yaml</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Defines a MetalLB community, which groups one or more BGP communities under a named resource. Communities can be applied to BGP advertisements to control routing policies and change traffic routing.</TableCell>
      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell>Load Balancer</TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>metallb.yaml</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Defines the MetalLB resource in the cluster.</TableCell>
      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
