      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
      <TableCell>NMState Operator</TableCell>
      <TableCell><code>NMStateOperGroup.yaml</code></TableCell>
      <TableCell>Creates the Operator group in the openshift-nmstate namespace, allowing the NMState Operator to watch and manage resources.</TableCell>
      <TableCell>No</TableCell>
      </TableRow>
      <TableRow>
